# 23. WAITING

Example:

```java
CompletableFuture
```

or:

```java
Object.wait();
```

Thread can show:

```text
WAITING
```

For example:

```java
synchronized (lock) {

    lock.wait();
}
```

The thread voluntarily waits.

---

# 24. TIMED_WAITING

Example:

```java
Thread.sleep(5000);
```

Thread state:

```text
TIMED_WAITING
```

Also:

```java
future.get(10, TimeUnit.SECONDS);
```

or:

```java
BlockingQueue.poll(10, TimeUnit.SECONDS);
```

