# 45. Example external API bottleneck

Thread dump:

```text
"http-nio-8080-exec-30"

TIMED_WAITING

at java.net.SocketInputStream.socketRead(...)
```

Many threads waiting here.

Possible:

```text
External API slow
Network problem
Read timeout too high
Connection pool exhausted
```

Solution:

```java
WebClient
```

with appropriate:

```text
connect timeout
response timeout
retry
circuit breaker
bulkhead
```

For example with Resilience4j:

```java
@CircuitBreaker(
    name = "paymentService",
    fallbackMethod = "fallback"
)
public PaymentResponse callPayment() {

    return paymentClient.call();
}
```

