# 59. Problems → Evidence → Solution

| Problem            | Evidence                       | Tool                  | Typical solution                  |
| ------------------ | ------------------------------ | --------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| Memory leak        | Heap keeps growing             | Heap dump             | Remove unintended references      |
| Unbounded cache    | Huge HashMap/ConcurrentHashMap | Heap dump             | TTL/max size                      |
| Huge API response  | Huge object graph              | Heap dump             | Pagination/streaming              |
| High CPU           | RUNNABLE threads               | Thread dump           | Optimize code/algorithm           |
| Deadlock           | BLOCKED threads                | Thread dump           | Consistent lock ordering          |
| Thread starvation  | Many waiting threads           | Thread dump           | Fix blocking operation/pool       |
| DB pool exhaustion | Threads waiting for connection | Thread dump + metrics | Tune DB/pool/query                |
| Frequent Young GC  | High allocation                | GC logs               | Reduce allocations                |
| Long GC pauses     | Large pause times              | GC logs               | Analyze heap/allocation/collector |
| Old Gen growth     | Objects survive GC             | GC logs + heap dump   | Find retained objects             |
| OOM                | Heap exhausted                 | Heap dump + GC logs   | Fix leak/usage pattern            |
| External API slow  | Socket wait                    | Thread dump           | Timeout/circuit breaker/bulkhead  |
| Container OOM      | Pod killed                     | JVM/container metrics | Leave native-memory headroom      |

